          "finding": "The hard-coded cgroup v1 memory path misses comounted hierarchies such as /sys/fs/cgroup/cpu,memory. cgroup_limit() silently ignores the failed reads, so HeapBudget::machine() falls back to host memory and can allow 8 GiB in a 2 GiB container. The fix is to resolve the mount point and root from /proc/self/mountinfo and join with /proc/self/cgroup."
